    "Backend.UrlShortener.create_short_code": {
      "file": "Backend/UrlShortener.py",
      "text": "+ creates a unique short code for a given long URL, using CodeGenerator to generate the code\naccepts a long URL\ncreates a unique short code for a given long URL\nuses CodeGenerator to generate the code\ngenerated codes must be unique per URL\nreturns the short code\n~ should return the same code when called twice with the same URL\n~ should generate unique codes per URL",
